<mj-text font-size="22px" line-height="30px" font-weight="bold" color="#0b0b0f">You have a reply from ilovelawyer support</mj-text>
<mj-text>Hello {{name}},</mj-text>
{{#if signedIn}}
<mj-text>Our team has replied to your message. Open the Support Chat to read it and to answer.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{link}}">Open the Support Chat</mj-button>
{{else}}
<mj-text>{{{replyHtml}}}</mj-text>
<mj-text>To reply, choose "Need help?" on the ilovelawyer sign-in page and give us this email address.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{link}}">Go to ilovelawyer</mj-button>
{{/if}}
